ching financial independence with relatively low annual spending and a smaller retirement corpus. It usually works best for people with simple lifestyles, lower fixed costs, and a strong ability to keep expenses under control.\\\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\\n50:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"4\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"w-full\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What is Fat FIRE?\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"svg\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\\\",\\\"fill\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"viewBox\\\":\\\"0 0 24 24\\\",\\\"stroke\\\":\\\"currentColor\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"path\\\",null,{\\\"strokeLinecap\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"strokeLinejoin\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"strokeWidth\\\":2,\\\"d\\\":\\\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\\\"}]}]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"💡\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Fat FIRE means building a larger corpus so you can maintain a more comfortable or premium lifestyle in retirement. It is usua