ll retirement.\\\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\\n52:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"6\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"w-full\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"How is retirement corpus calculated?\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"svg\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\\\",\\\"fill\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"viewBox\\\":\\\"0 0 24 24\\\",\\\"stroke\\\":\\\"currentColor\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"path\\\",null,{\\\"strokeLinecap\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"strokeLinejoin\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"strokeWidth\\\":2,\\\"d\\\":\\\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\\\"}]}]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"💡\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"A simple retirement corpus formula is: annual expenses divided by safe withdrawal rate. For example, if your annual expenses are ₹6,00,000 and you use a 4% withdrawal rate, the estimated corpus is ₹1.5 crore. If you expect inflation to rise before retirement, you should inflate the expense figure first.\\\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\\n53:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"7\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"w-full\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"How does inflation affect retirement planning?\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"svg\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\\\",\\\"fill\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"viewBox\\\":\\\"0 0 24 24\\\",\\\"stroke\\\":\\\"currentColor\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"path\\\",null,{\\\"strokeLinecap\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"strokeLinejoin\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"strokeWidth\\\":2,\\\"d\\\":\\\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\\\"}]}]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"💡\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Inflation increases the cost of future living expenses, which means the same lifestyle will cost more later. A retirement plan that ignores inflation usually underestimates the corpus needed, especially over long horizons such as 20 to 30 years.\\\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\\n54:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"8\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"details\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"w-full\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"summary\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"What is a safe withdrawal rate?\\\"}]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"svg\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\\\",\\\"fill\\\":\\\"none\\\",\\\"viewBox\\\":\\\"0 0 24 24\\\",\\\"stroke\\\":\\\"currentColor\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"path\\\",null,{\\\"strokeLinecap\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"strokeLinejoin\\\":\\\"round\\\",\\\"strokeWidth\\\":2,\\\"d\\\":\\\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\\\"}]}]}]]}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\\\",\\\"children\\\":[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"span\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"💡\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"A safe withdrawal rate is the percentage of your retirement corpus you can withdraw each year while trying to make the money last. Many people start with 4%, but the right number depends on market conditions, portfolio mix, taxes, and the number of years you expect retirement to last.\\\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\\n55:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",\\\"9\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidd