ildren\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Sequence of returns risk is the danger that poor market returns happen early in retirement, which can damage portfolio longevity more than the same returns arriving later. This matters especially when you are withdrawing money regularly from the portfolio.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n61:[\"$\",\"div\",\"21\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"Can I retire at 40?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Retiring at 40 is possible for some people, but it usually requires a high savings rate, strong investment discipline, and a plan that can support many decades of expenses. Early retirement also increases the importance of inflation control and sequence of returns risk.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n62:[\"$\",\"div\",\"22\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"Can I retire at 50?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Yes, retiring at 50 is often more achievable than retiring at 40 because you may have more years to build your corpus. The key is to estimate your future expenses carefully and make sure your portfolio can support a long withdrawal period.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n63:[\"$\",\"div\",\"23\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-cente