:\"text-xs leading-7 text-white/65\",\"children\":\"This retirement calculator covers retirement corpus calculation, retirement planning in India, FIRE number calculation, Lean FIRE, Fat FIRE, Coast FIRE, retirement income planning, SWP income, inflation-adjusted retirement expenses, safe withdrawal rates, retirement savings targets, retirement corpus by age, retirement planning for couples, retirement planning for salaried employees, retirement planning with SIP investments, financial independence, early retirement planning, retirement cash flow projections, retirement withdrawal strategies, and retirement sustainability analysis.\"}]]}]\n4b:[\"$\",\"section\",null,{\"aria-labelledby\":\"faq-heading\",\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"faq-heading\",\"className\":\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight\",\"children\":\"Frequently Asked Questions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"How much retirement corpus do I need?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"The retirement corpus you need depends on your annual expenses, expected inflation, life expectancy, and safe withdrawal rate. A common planning shortcut is annual expenses multiplied by 25, which is based on the 4% rule, but many users in India prefer to use a more conservative rate because inflation and healthcare costs can rise faster than expected.\"}]]}]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"What is the 4% withdrawal rule?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"The 4% withdrawal rule says you may be able to withdraw about 4% of your retirement corpus in the first year of retirement and then increase that amount with inflation each year. It is a planning guideline, not a guarantee, and the actual safe rate depends on asset allocation, market returns, taxes, and how long retirement lasts.\"}]]}]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"What is FIRE?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":\"$L4d\"}]]}],\"$L4e\"]}]}],\"$L4f\",\"$L50\",\"$L51\",\"$L52\",\"$L53\",\"$L54\",\"$L55\",\"$L56\",\"$L57\",\"$L58\",\"$L59\",\"$L5a\",\"$L5b\",\"$L5c\",\"$L5d\",\"$L5e\",\"$L5f\",\"$L60\",\"$L61\",\"$L62\",\"$L63\",\"$L64\",\"$L65\",\"$L66\",\"$L67\",\"$L68\",\"$L69\"]}]]}]\n4c:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Retirement corpus formula\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-xs leading-6 text-white/65\",\"children\":\"A simple formula is: Annual Expenses ÷ Safe Withdrawal Rate. Another common version is: Annual Expenses × Retirement Multiple. For example, if annual expenses are ₹6 lakh and withdrawal rate is 4%, the estimated corpus is ₹1.5 crore.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 p-5\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-semibold\",\"children\":\"Retirement planning example\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-xs leading-6 text-white/65\",\"children\":\"If current age is 30, retirement age is 60, monthly expenses are ₹50,000, inflation is 6%, and expected return is 11%, the projected retirement corpus needed can easily move beyond ₹4.5 crore depending on assumptions.\"}]]}]]}]\n4d:[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]\n4e:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"FIRE stands for Financial Independence, Retire Early. It is a planning approach where you save and invest aggressively so your portfolio can eventually fund your living expenses without relying on active employment.\"}]]}]}]\n4f:[\"$\",\"div\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"What is Lean FIRE?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Lean FIRE means reaching financial independence with relatively low annual spending and a smaller retirement corpus. It usually works best for people with simple lifestyles, lower fixed costs, and a strong ability to keep expenses under control.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n50:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"What is Fat FIRE?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Fat FIRE means building a larger corpus so you can maintain a more comfortable or premium lifestyle in retirement. It is usually relevant for households with higher expenses, travel goals, or a desire for more spending flexibility.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n51:[\"$\",\"div\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"What is Coast FIRE?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Coast FIRE means you have already invested enough that, if you stop adding new money, your existing corpus may still grow to support retirement by the time you stop working. It is popular among people who want more career flexibility before full retirement.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n52:[\"$\",\"div\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"How is retirement corpus calculated?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"A simple retirement corpus formula is: annual expenses divided by safe withdrawal rate. For example, if your annual expenses are ₹6,00,000 and you use a 4% withdrawal rate, the estimated corpus is ₹1.5 crore. If you expect inflation to rise before retirement, you should inflate the expense figure first.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n53:[\"$\",\"div\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"