rawal rate?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"A safe withdrawal rate is the percentage of your retirement corpus you can withdraw each year while trying to make the money last. Many people start with 4%, but the right number depends on market conditions, portfolio mix, taxes, and the number of years you expect retirement to last.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n55:[\"$\",\"div\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"How much monthly income can my corpus generate?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Your corpus can generate monthly income through SWP, where a fixed amount is withdrawn each month while the remaining portfolio continues to grow. The actual income depends on corpus size, expected return, withdrawal period, inflation, and taxes.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n56:[\"$\",\"div\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"Can I retire early?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Yes, early retirement is possible if your savings rate is high enough and your investments grow consistently over time. The key is to estimate your FIRE number realistically and test whether your portfolio can support your expenses for a longer retirement period.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n57:[\"$\",\"div\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"What age should I start retirement planning?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"The best time to start retirement planning is as early as possible because compounding has more time to work. Even small monthly investments can become significant over a 20- to 30-year horizon if you start early and stay consistent.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n58:[\"$\",\"div\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"What return rate should I assume?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Use a return rate that matches your asset allocation and risk tolerance. Equity-heavy portfolios may justify higher long-term expectations, while debt-heavy or conservative portfolios should use lower assumptions so your plan does not become overly optimistic.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n59:[\"$\",\"div\",\"13\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"How long will my retirement corpus last?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Your corpus longevity depends on your withdrawal amount, investment returns, inflation, taxes, and how long you live. A calculator can estimate sustainability, but the result should be treated as planning guidance rather than a guaranteed outcome.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n5a:[\"$\",\"div\",\"14\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"What happens if inflation is higher than expected?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"If inflation rises faster than expected, your future expenses will increase and your corpus may need to be larger than originally planned. This is why many retirement plans use a margin of safety and review assumptions regularly.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n5b:[\"$\",\"div\",\"15\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"Should I include pensions in retirement planning?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 m