"children\":\"Retirement planning example\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 text-xs leading-6 text-white/65\",\"children\":\"If current age is 30, retirement age is 60, monthly expenses are ₹50,000, inflation is 6%, and expected return is 11%, the projected retirement corpus needed can easily move beyond ₹4.5 crore depending on assumptions.\"}]]}]]}]\n45:[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]\n46:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"FIRE stands for Financial Independence, Retire Early. It is a planning approach where you save and invest aggressively so your portfolio can eventually fund your living expenses without relying on active employment.\"}]]}]}]\n47:[\"$\",\"div\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"What is Lean FIRE?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Lean FIRE means reaching financial independence with relatively low annual spending and a smaller retirement corpus. It usually works best for people with simple lifestyles, lower fixed costs, and a strong ability to keep expenses under control.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n48:[\"$\",\"div\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"What is Fat FIRE?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Fat FIRE means building a larger corpus so you can maintain a more comfortable or premium lifestyle in retirement. It is usually relevant for households with higher expenses, travel goals, or a desire for more spending flexibility.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n49:[\"$\",\"div\",\"5\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"What is Coast FIRE?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Coast FIRE means you have already invested enough that, if you stop adding new money, your existing corpus may still grow to support retirement by the time you stop working. It is popular among people who want more career flexibility before full retirement.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n4a:[\"$\",\"div\",\"6\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"How is retirement corpus calculated?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"A simple retirement corpus formula is: annual expenses divided by safe withdrawal rate. For example, if your annual expenses are ₹6,00,000 and you use a 4% withdrawal rate, the estimated corpus is ₹1.5 crore. If you expect inflation to rise before retirement, you should inflate the expense figure first.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n4b:[\"$\",\"div\",\"7\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"How does inflation affect retirement planning?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Inflation increases the cost of future living expenses, which means the same lifestyle will cost more later. A retirement plan that ignores inflation usually underestimates the corpus needed, especially over long horizons such as 20 to 30 years.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n4c:[\"$\",\"div\",\"8\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"What is a safe withdrawal rate?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"A safe withdrawal rate is the percentage of your retirement corpus you can withdraw each year while trying to make the money last. Many people start with 4%, but the right number depends on market conditions, portfolio mix, taxes, and the number of years you expect retirement to last.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n4d:[\"$\",\"div\",\"9\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"How much monthly income can my corpus generate?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Your corpus can generate monthly income through SWP, where a fixed amount is withdrawn each month while the remaining portfolio continues to grow. The actual income depends on corpus size, expected return, withdrawal period, inflation, and taxes.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n4e:[\"$\",\"div\",\"10\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"Can I retire early?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"Yes, early retirement is possible if your savings rate is high enough and your investments grow consistently over time. The key is to estimate your FIRE number realistically and test whether your portfolio can support your expenses for a longer retirement period.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n4f:[\"$\",\"div\",\"11\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"details\",null,{\"className\":\"w-full\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"summary\",null,{\"className\":\"list-none p-5 flex items-center justify-between gap-4 hover:bg-white/10   cursor-pointer\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 flex-1\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white font-semibold text-sm\",\"children\":\"What age should I start retirement planning?\"}]}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0 -transform duration-300\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"className\":\"w-5 h-5 transform -transform duration-300 open:rotate-180\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"path\",null,{\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"d\":\"M19 9l-7 7-7-7\"}]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"p-5 pt-0 border-t border-white/5 border-dashed\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-start gap-3 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"text-blue-400 text-lg flex-shrink-0\",\"children\":\"💡\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white/60 text-xs leading-relaxed\",\"children\":\"The best time to start retirement planning is as early as possible because compounding has more time to work. Even small monthly investments can become significant over a 20- to 30-year horizon if you start early and stay consistent.\"}]]}]}]]}]}]\n50:[\"$\",\"div\",\"12\",{\"className\":\"group rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/5 overflow-hidden  duration-300\"